        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek S50003, Stainless Steel Square Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Square Stainless Steel Single Cylinder Deadbolt made by Emtek is a great choice for any home remodel not just because of its contemporary, square shape but also for its ease of installation. This Modern Square Single Cylinder Stainless Steel Deadbolt will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 3 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. This is a single cylinder deadbolt so the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. The Stainless Steel Square Single Cylinder Deadbolt  has a brushed stainless steel finish for durability, as it hides scratches and fingerprints alike. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Square Single Cylinder Stainless Steel Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Stainless steel strike.</li>\r\n<li>Stainless steel collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with a extension collar for thin doors.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Contemporary Square Brushed Stainless Steel Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Length: 2-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: .65\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Overall Projection: 1.175\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Thumbturn Projection: .75\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Square Stainless Steel Single Cylinder Deadbolt,",
                "description": "The Modern Square Stainless Steel Single Cylinder Deadbolt made by Emtek is a great choice for any home remodel not just because of its contemporary, square shape but also for its ease of installation. This Modern Square Single Cylinder Stainless Steel Deadbolt will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 3 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. This is a single cylinder deadbolt so the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. The Stainless Steel Square Single Cylinder Deadbolt  has a brushed stainless steel finish for durability, as it hides scratches and fingerprints alike.",
